---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /reviews/
seoTitle: "Reviews: 133 Five Star Google Reviews | Charter Fishing Tampa Bay"
description: "Real five star reviews of our Tampa Bay fishing guides, word for word: an 80 lb bull shark, 80+ fish in a day, a birthday shark. 133 Google reviews."
ctaHeading: "Ready to write the next one?"
---
{% set G %}<svg class="pf-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.54 0 6.71 1.22 9.21 3.6l6.85-6.85C35.9 2.38 30.47 0 24 0 14.62 0 6.51 5.38 2.56 13.22l7.98 6.19C12.43 13.72 17.74 9.5 24 9.5z"/><path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.98 24.55c0-1.57-.15-3.09-.38-4.55H24v9.02h12.94c-.58 2.96-2.26 5.48-4.78 7.18l7.73 6c4.51-4.18 7.09-10.36 7.09-17.65z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.53 28.59c-.48-1.45-.76-2.99-.76-4.59s.27-3.14.76-4.59l-7.98-6.19C.92 16.46 0 20.12 0 24c0 3.88.92 7.54 2.56 10.78l7.97-6.19z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.48 0 11.93-2.13 15.89-5.81l-7.73-6c-2.15 1.45-4.92 2.3-8.16 2.3-6.26 0-11.57-4.22-13.47-9.91l-7.98 6.19C6.51 42.62 14.62 48 24 48z"/></svg>{% endset %}
{% set FB %}<svg class="pf-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="#1877F2"/><path fill="#fff" d="M15.12 12.5h-2.1V20h-3.1v-7.5H8.4V9.86h1.52V8.15c0-1.25.6-3.2 3.2-3.2h2.37v2.57h-1.72c-.28 0-.68.14-.68.74v1.6h2.4z"/></svg>{% endset %}
{% set CE %}<svg class="pf-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="#12304B"/><path d="M12 5.5a1.6 1.6 0 1 1 0 3.2 1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0-3.2zm-.75 3.2h1.5v8.6c1.9-.3 3.4-1.6 3.9-3.4h-1.6l2.4-2.6 2.1 2.6h-1.4c-.6 3-3.3 5.2-6.4 5.2s-5.8-2.2-6.4-5.2H4l2.1-2.6 2.4 2.6H6.9c.5 1.8 2 3.1 3.9 3.4V8.7z" fill="#F7931E"/></svg>{% endset %}
{% set FBK %}<svg class="pf-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="#0B6E8E"/><path d="M5 12c2.2-2.8 4.8-4.2 7.6-4.2 2.3 0 4.3 1 6 2.6L21 9v6l-2.4-1.4c-1.7 1.6-3.7 2.6-6 2.6-2.8 0-5.4-1.4-7.6-4.2zm9.6-1.1a.9.9 0 1 0 0 1.8.9.9 0 0 0 0-1.8z" fill="#fff"/></svg>{% endset %}
{% set WEB %}<svg class="pf-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="#F7931E"/><path d="M12 5a7 7 0 1 0 0 14 7 7 0 0 0 0-14zm4.8 6.2h-2.1a11 11 0 0 0-.9-3.9 5.6 5.6 0 0 1 3 3.9zM12 6.6c.6.8 1.1 2.4 1.3 4.6h-2.6c.2-2.2.7-3.8 1.3-4.6zm-1.8.7a11 11 0 0 0-.9 3.9H7.2a5.6 5.6 0 0 1 3-3.9zm-3 5.5h2.1c.1 1.5.4 2.8.9 3.9a5.6 5.6 0 0 1-3-3.9zm4.8 4.6c-.6-.8-1.1-2.4-1.3-4.6h2.6c-.2 2.2-.7 3.8-1.3 4.6zm1.8-.7c.5-1.1.8-2.4.9-3.9h2.1a5.6 5.6 0 0 1-3 3.9z" fill="#0B2238"/></svg>{% endset %}
{% set STARS %}<span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span>{% endset %}

<section class="page-hero rv-hero" style="--hero:url(/images/two-anglers-redfish.webp)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>133 Five Star Google Reviews</h1>
    <p class="lead">That's what guests have left for our crew on Google. Here's what they keep saying, word for word.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section rv-platforms-wrap">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rv-platforms">
      <div class="rv-pf rv-pf-main">{{ G | safe }}<div><p class="rv-pf-name">Google</p><p class="rv-pf-score">5.0 {{ STARS | safe }}</p><p class="rv-pf-count"><strong>133</strong> reviews</p></div></div>
      <div class="rv-pf">{{ FB | safe }}<div><p class="rv-pf-name">Facebook</p><p class="rv-pf-score">Recommended</p></div></div>
      <div class="rv-pf">{{ CE | safe }}<div><p class="rv-pf-name">Captain Experiences</p><p class="rv-pf-score">5.0 {{ STARS | safe }}</p></div></div>
      <div class="rv-pf">{{ FBK | safe }}<div><p class="rv-pf-name">FishingBooker</p></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="rv-split">
      <div class="rv-score">
        <p class="eyebrow">One crew</p>
        <p class="rv-big">5.0</p>
        <p class="rv-big-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</p>
        <p class="rv-big-sub"><strong>133</strong> five star Google reviews</p>
        <p>Every one of our captains holds a perfect 5.0 on Google.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>In their words</h2>
        <ul class="rv-praise">
          <li>"Knows the bay like the back of his hand"</li>
          <li>"Putting us on the fish all day long"</li>
          <li>"Best Captain on the Bay"</li>
          <li>"Fish on every stop"</li>
          <li>"Great with kids"</li>
          <li>"Non-stop action"</li>
          <li>"Dialed in on the fish"</li>
          <li>"Calm cool demeanor"</li>
          <li>"Filling our freezer"</li>
          <li>"Knew exactly where to go"</li>
          <li>"Hands down the best fishing charter"</li>
          <li>"Lots of lip rippin"</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band-navy section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Straight from the reviews</p>
    <h2>Days people wrote home about</h2>
    <div class="rv-moments">
      <div class="rv-moment"><strong>80 lb</strong><span>bull shark landed, "and a big one that got away"</span><em>Jason P.</em></div>
      <div class="rv-moment"><strong>80+</strong><span>fish in one trip with two nephews</span><em>Kyle N.</em></div>
      <div class="rv-moment"><strong>7 years</strong><span>waiting for a legal slot snook, then got one</span><em>Dennis R.</em></div>
      <div class="rv-moment"><strong>Dec 23</strong><span>caught "enough fish to feed the whole family for Christmas dinner"</span><em>Xella D.</em></div>
      <div class="rv-moment"><strong>12th</strong><span>birthday, and a shark he'll "never forget"</span><em>Darby L. H.</em></div>
      <div class="rv-moment"><strong>11</strong><span>keepers on a Clearwater vacation, "so many fish we lost count"</span><em>Kim H.</em></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">The review wall</p><h2>Read them for yourself</h2></div></div>
    <div class="rv-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter reviews by topic">
      <button type="button" class="rv-chip is-on" data-f="all">All reviews</button>
      <button type="button" class="rv-chip" data-f="fish">Lots of fish</button>
      <button type="button" class="rv-chip" data-f="family">Families and kids</button>
      <button type="button" class="rv-chip" data-f="knowledge">Know the water</button>
      <button type="button" class="rv-chip" data-f="table">Fish for dinner</button>
      <button type="button" class="rv-chip" data-f="back">Coming back</button>
    </div>
    <div class="rv-wall">
    {% for r in allReviews %}
      <figure class="rv-card" data-t=" {{ r.tags | join(' ') }} ">
        <div class="rv-card-top">{% if r.platform == "google" %}{{ G | safe }}{% elif r.platform == "facebook" %}{{ FB | safe }}{% elif r.platform == "captainexperiences" %}{{ CE | safe }}{% else %}{{ WEB | safe }}{% endif %}{{ STARS | safe }}</div>
        <blockquote>"{{ r.quote }}"</blockquote>
        <figcaption><strong>{{ r.name }}</strong>{% if r.date %} · {{ r.date }}{% endif %}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="rv-note">Reviews appear as written, typos and all. Meet the crew on <a href="/about/">Our Captains</a>, see photos in the <a href="/gallery/">gallery</a>, or compare trips on the <a href="/charters/">charters page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
(function(){var chips=document.querySelectorAll('.rv-chip'),cards=document.querySelectorAll('.rv-card');
chips.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){chips.forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('is-on',x===b)});var f=b.getAttribute('data-f');cards.forEach(function(c){c.hidden=!(f==='all'||c.getAttribute('data-t').indexOf(' '+f+' ')>-1)})})});})();
</script>
